            "id": "b2a5d0d0-5a18-5716-b67e-ca890788d64a",
            "heading": "Phil Announces Partnership with Impel NeuroPharma in Support of Trudhesa™ (dihydroergotamine mesylate) Nasal Spray for the Acute Treatment of Migraine",
